{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[],"persons":[{"id":"shaodi-p0164","name":"郑熙","evidence":["shaodi-q-o118"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"shaodi-m-o118-shaodi-p0164","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["shaodi-q-o118"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"shaodi-q-o118","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-8403a63094c93eb298b0","layer":"original","quote":"夏四月，癸卯〖2〗，诏曰：“玄菟郡高显县吏民反叛〖3〗，长郑熙为贼所杀。民王简，负担熙丧，晨夜星行，远致本州〖4〗。忠节可嘉，其特拜简为忠义都尉，以旌殊行〖5〗。”甲子〖6〗，以征东大将军诸葛诞为司空。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":523,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":101,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
